Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.87,0:00:11.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.48,0:00:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些猎人已经失控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These Hunters are out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.97,0:00:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是温家兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The brothers Winchester, in particular,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而贝维尔夫人早已竭力阐明\N{\fnArial\fs30}which Lady Bevell has exhaustedly documented.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.64,0:00:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,收服美国猎人的大实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}The grand experiment recruiting American Hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.52,0:00:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}has failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.51,0:00:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要我怎么做 - 铲除他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What would you like me to do? - Exterminate them,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.64,0:00:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个不剩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every…last…one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.13,0:00:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是个孩子 那是路西法的后代\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a baby. This is the spawn of Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.85,0:00:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小卡 - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cass? - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.27,0:00:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在知道 这个孩子必须降生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know now that this child must be born.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.42,0:00:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且保留他的法力\N{\fnArial\fs30}with all of his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.71,0:00:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,海斯博士想了解一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Hess wants to know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.63,0:00:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,温家兄弟的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉我之前没接 我跟凯奇猎魔去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry I couldn't pick up before. I've been on a hunt with Ketch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.11,0:00:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我们有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean? We've got a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.94,0:00:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国猎人完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the end for the American Hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.50,0:00:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我可以保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.27,0:01:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你乖乖配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you play nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从不会乖乖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't play nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.29,0:01:14.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.15,0:01:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗狗乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.14,0:02:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第12季第21集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.55,0:02:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.19,0:02:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.66,0:02:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来她有一阵没来这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, looks like she hasn't been here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.70,0:02:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 她的东西都不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. All her stuff is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.31,0:02:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有说她要离开这儿吗 还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she say she was moving on or…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.67,0:02:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我把她的话告诉你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I told you what she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.79,0:02:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说「迪恩 打给我 我们有麻烦了」\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said, "Dean, call me. We have a problem."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.85,0:02:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就没了 她语气可不太愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then that was it. She didn't sound happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.38,0:02:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 她不在这里时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, when she's not here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.85,0:02:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就住在英国人那里 那或许\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's been bunking with the Brits. So maybe …
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.68,0:02:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 我给米克打六通电话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, dude, I've called Mick, like, six times.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.03,0:02:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从他被派去伦敦就一直杳无音信\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been radio silent since they sent him to London.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.67,0:03:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯奇 我想问问我妈是不是在你那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ketch, calling to see if my Mom's with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.12,0:03:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.07,0:03:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.91,0:03:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为我想跟她说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'd like to speak to her, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.06,0:03:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不是不耐烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not being terse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.04,0:03:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你没见着她 你知道她在哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if you haven't seen her, do you know where she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.44,0:03:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我也没粗暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not being curt either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.09,0:03:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没工夫听你讲基本礼仪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't have time for Manners 101 from you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.51,0:03:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她在你那儿 我想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she's with you, I wanna know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.49,0:03:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.18,0:03:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.68,0:03:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么样 - 他说他一周多没见着妈妈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And? - He says he hasn't seen Mom in over a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.99,0:03:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但妈妈两天前才打来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Mom called two days ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.18,0:03:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,说在跟他办案\N{\fnArial\fs30}said she was working a case with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.17,0:03:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他撒谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means he's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.25,0:03:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他为什么要\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why would he …
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.69,0:03:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.51,0:03:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪 没 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody, hey. No, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.09,0:03:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们没听说 - 妈妈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, we hadn't heard. - Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.56,0:03:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}When? What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.32,0:03:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. No, I-I…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.27,0:04:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 多谢告知我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, thanks for letting me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.43,0:04:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.94,0:04:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eileen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.96,0:04:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么死的 - 她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How? - She was, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.31,0:04:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,在林子里被一只野兽咬死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}mauled by a wild animal in a wooded area.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.69,0:04:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那一带就没有那样的猛兽 南卡罗莱纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}that doesn't have animals that do that, in South Carolina.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.96,0:04:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是在爱尔兰吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I thought she was in Ireland.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.12,0:04:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.14,0:04:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 这是我们两周来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, that's the second Hunter death.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.22,0:04:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二起听闻的猎人死亡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've heard about in two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.66,0:04:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但两个不算规律\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. But two doesn't mean a pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.80,0:04:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three would.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.62,0:04:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.90,0:04:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈也是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom's a Hunter,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.09,0:04:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在没人知道她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no one knows where she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.93,0:04:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,干我们这行的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}People who do what we do,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.84,0:04:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道总会有人送命 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know there are gonna be deaths, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.99,0:05:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.82,0:05:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}These wounds … I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.93,0:05:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么严重的我们也就见过几次\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've only seen something this bad a few times.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.27,0:05:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellhound?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.19,0:05:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但这毫无道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. But it doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.05,0:05:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔为什么要对她放地狱猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would a … why would a demon sic a hellhound on her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她又为什么离开爱尔兰 - 我不知道 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why did she leave Ireland? - I don't know, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.99,0:05:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 算上艾琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, counting Eileen,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.65,0:05:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么三周里有七个猎人死掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that makes seven Hunters in three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.49,0:05:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 这还是我们知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and those are the ones we know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.11,0:05:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,七起与怪物有关的死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven monster-related deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.14,0:05:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 外面那些怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what, did all the things out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.35,0:05:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然开始合作了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}suddenly start working together?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.60,0:05:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 怪物和恶魔不会联手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, monsters and demons don't team up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.43,0:05:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了七个猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven Hunters are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.38,0:05:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直搜不到妈妈手机的信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't grab a signal from Mom's phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.01,0:05:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡带着凯莉·克莱恩去了鬼知道哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass has Kelly Kline who knows where.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,米克消失不见 凯奇在对我们撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mick has slipped off the grid. Ketch is lying to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.79,0:05:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.24,0:05:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想揍点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna punch something in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.30,0:05:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.74,0:05:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,留着那股怒气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on to that,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.83,0:05:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为看来我们得对付一只地狱猎犬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause it looks like we got a hellhound to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.59,0:05:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.26,0:05:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还要重复多少遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times do I have to repeat myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.11,0:06:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我找到凯莉·克莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find me Kelly Kline!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.60,0:06:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个概念简直简单到可笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a concept, it's ridiculously simple,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}as are you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.84,0:06:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,请别吼我 我在尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't yell. I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我尽力了」 那再更努力点\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'm trying." Well, try harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.04,0:06:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像你可怜的生命就指着它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As if your almost-life depended on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.98,0:06:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 吾王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my King.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.82,0:06:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,说 你都知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bear down. What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.18,0:06:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道大衮已死 不能保护凯莉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know Dagon is dead and can't protect Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.27,0:06:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你的任务该更简单了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which makes your task even easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.49,0:06:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道路西法的儿子就要生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know Lucifer's son is almost due.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.24,0:06:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你的任务就更重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which makes your task more crucial.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.56,0:06:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道 我们不知道他降生后会多么强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know we don't know how powerful he'll be when born.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.30,0:06:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你就是白痴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which makes you an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.26,0:06:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.99,0:06:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来 你和我派去执行这项任务的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, you and the legion of demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.87,0:06:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔大军\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I've assigned to this task.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.99,0:06:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有得到足够的激励\N{\fnArial\fs30}haven't been motivated properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.35,0:06:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟我来 - 你要活剥我的皮吗 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Follow me. - You going to skin me alive, Sire?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.75,0:06:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么简单还好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would it be that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.87,0:06:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要提醒你和你们那群废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to remind you and your team of screwups.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.81,0:06:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,优秀工作的骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the pride of superior work,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.33,0:06:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,取悦我的兴奋感\N{\fnArial\fs30}the thrill of pleasing me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.81,0:06:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及多活一天的满足感\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the gratification of living one more day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.77,0:07:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.31,0:07:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.44,0:07:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进啊 坐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please come in. Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.82,0:07:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.73,0:07:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有我的地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you have my address,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.75,0:07:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但没有我的电话吗 - 一时兴起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but not my phone number? - Spur of the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.36,0:07:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人说这附近有个吸血鬼巢穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone dropped a dime on a vamp nest near here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.69,0:07:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道什么吗 - 我才听说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got anything? - No, news to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.30,0:07:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,想加入吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want in?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.65,0:07:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.79,0:07:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.00,0:07:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How ya been?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.69,0:07:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.80,0:07:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那群英国混蛋老来纠缠我\N{\fnArial\fs30}taking plenty of heat from the Brit Dicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我加入茶点小队\N{\fnArial\fs30}to join the tea and crumpet squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.17,0:07:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可不愿接受拒绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they do not want to take "No" for an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.04,0:07:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.88,0:07:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要啤酒吗 - 好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Want a beer? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.42,0:07:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.75,0:07:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他们的 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, screw them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.83,0:08:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们觉得都这么多年了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they think, after all these years…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.29,0:08:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天感觉如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}How are we doing today?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.82,0:08:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.35,0:08:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,又出眼袋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those eye bags again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.94,0:08:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚发生什么事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did something happen last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.07,0:08:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,能说具体点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you be more specific?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.00,0:08:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我离开这栋楼了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was I out of this building?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.10,0:08:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你该比我更清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you would know that better than I.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.52,0:08:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你无法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you're having trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.50,0:08:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,区分事实和虚幻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}distinguishing fact from fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.26,0:09:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样吗 玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's going on, Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.16,0:09:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.46,0:09:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.68,0:09:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在给我洗脑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're brainwashing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.78,0:09:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在被…重组\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're being…realigned.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.20,0:09:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快 你将无法区分你自己和我们的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon, you won't differentiate between your thinking and ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.12,0:09:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的想法和行为都将来自我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of your thoughts and actions will come from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.99,0:09:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.29,0:09:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正不是你抓着不放的对自己的错觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not about this illusion of you that you hold on to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.85,0:09:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}The perfect life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.13,0:09:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有爱的丈夫和孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loving husband and kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.43,0:09:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切本就不完美 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it never really was perfect, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.56,0:09:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对你深爱的约翰隐瞒的那些秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those secrets you kept from your beloved John …
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.34,0:09:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾经的猎人生涯\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you were a Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.57,0:10:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚撒色饶了约翰一命 作为交换 你允许他来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you invited Azazel to visit when he spared John's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.53,0:10:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么 - 我有眼线 玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you - I have sources, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.70,0:10:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.25,0:10:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you died,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.38,0:10:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你挚爱的约翰为寻求复仇慢慢变得疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}your beloved John was a man slowly going mad, searching for revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.45,0:10:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你儿子没告诉你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Your boys didn't tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.17,0:10:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝酒发狂 消失数周\N{\fnArial\fs30}The drunken rages? The weeks of abandonment?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.63,0:10:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是虐待儿童\N{\fnArial\fs30}Child abuse, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.53,0:10:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪不得他们那么…不健全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no wonder they're… damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.64,0:10:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.71,0:10:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再沉湎童话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}enough with the fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.53,0:10:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要让你回归更纯粹的自我\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are returning you to a more pure version of yourself …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.84,0:10:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽·坎贝尔 天生杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary Campbell, natural born killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.66,0:10:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.31,0:10:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国猎人没有如我们所愿乖乖合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}The American Hunters haven't fallen into line as we'd hoped,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.52,0:10:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要被清除\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they're being eliminated,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.31,0:10:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,由我们的人铲除并顶替\N{\fnArial\fs30}repealed and replaced by our people,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.41,0:11:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you, Mary,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.61,0:11:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要在其中扮演关键角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}you play a key role in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.50,0:11:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.95,0:11:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.71,0:11:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe you already have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.72,0:11:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有趣的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.98,0:11:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快你将无法选择了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon you won't be making any.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.08,0:11:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,下午好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.51,0:11:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,海斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Hess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.77,0:11:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是那么美丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stunningly beautiful as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.26,0:11:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.93,0:11:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是那么虚伪得让人反胃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revoltingly unctuous as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.96,0:11:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们直说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's cut to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.92,0:12:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在让你的人屠杀美国猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have your people slaughtering the American Hunters,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.46,0:12:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用说 这我支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}which, naturally, I applaud.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.14,0:12:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.42,0:12:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给了亚瑟·凯奇一只地狱猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I provided Arthur Ketch with a hellhound.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.95,0:12:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜他不是想要养宠物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think he was looking for a pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.34,0:12:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然 你们组织是想在此扎根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously, your organization is looking to put down roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.44,0:12:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想确保你我之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to make doubly sure that you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.05,0:12:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以在美国延续\N{\fnArial\fs30}have the same arrangement in the States.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.68,0:12:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在英国的协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we do in the U.K.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.12,0:12:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么不可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see why not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.42,0:12:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要开战 两边都不输\N{\fnArial\fs30}No point being at war. No sides lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.67,0:12:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你的恶魔只针对\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your demons limit their involvement.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.25,0:12:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些愚蠢的 甘愿出卖灵魂的人类…\N{\fnArial\fs30}to humans idiotic enough to sell their souls…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.37,0:12:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没问题 - 信息共享呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Done. - And share information?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.39,0:12:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}As needed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.45,0:12:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜找到那个拿非利人是头等大事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume finding that infernal nephilim is a top priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.56,0:12:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,鉴于它能杀了你 我 和整个宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since it could kill you, me, and the entire universe,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.84,0:12:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或许吧 - 我喜欢团队合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}- probably. - I am a team player.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.31,0:12:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的恶魔这会儿正在全国搜索\N{\fnArial\fs30}My demons are scouring the country as I speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.22,0:12:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你注意到我的如释重负了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you notice my sigh of relief?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.13,0:12:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.64,0:12:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There wasn't one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.48,0:13:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力 还有件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley, one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.71,0:13:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.84,0:13:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟温家兄弟的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your relationship with the Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.72,0:13:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来有点太亲近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bit cozy for my taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.30,0:13:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你不会指望我放过你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you don't expect me to spare your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.82,0:13:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的检查结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That completes my examination.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.57,0:13:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,德雷克索 我虽然很喜欢跟你一天天地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Drexel, as much as I enjoy playing doctor with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.18,0:13:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩医生游戏 我需要马上离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}day after day, I need to blow this joint now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.35,0:13:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,请您耐心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg you to be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.30,0:13:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能关闭安保装置之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until I get the security device shut off,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.95,0:14:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是属于克劳力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you completely belong to Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.90,0:14:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它法力已降至最低 而我又状态满格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, if it's at minimum power, and I'm at maximum power,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.85,0:14:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁可一试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll roll the dice, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.54,0:14:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 我毫不知情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, I don't know anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.31,0:14:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全没听过什么艾琳·莱希\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name Eileen Leahy means nothing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.08,0:14:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力 只有恶魔能控制地狱猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley, only a demon can control a hellhound,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.81,0:14:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 肯定跟你的人有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means that one of your people was involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.00,0:14:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是这样 我肯定会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that were the case, I would know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.27,0:14:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有地狱猎犬失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no missing hellhounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.79,0:14:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昨晚才抱过它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was cuddling with them just last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.74,0:14:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. And you know nothing else of.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.55,0:14:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他猎人一个个死亡的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}the other Hunters who are dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.47,0:14:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不仅不知道 还不关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not only don't I know, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.05,0:14:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想到你还喜欢抱抱 克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never thought of you as a cuddler, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.18,0:14:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,多说说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.14,0:14:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,多说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}More?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.27,0:14:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我考虑了你的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been giving thought to your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.19,0:14:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为我的奴隶 你可以当武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}As my slave, you could be useful as a weapon,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.16,0:14:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,屠杀我的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}laying waste to my enemies,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.51,0:14:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先就是某个英国贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}starting with a certain British bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.67,0:14:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,动不动就对我下最后通牒\N{\fnArial\fs30}who's far too comfortable giving me ultimatums.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.49,0:14:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,说完了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.16,0:14:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.77,0:15:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你知道凯莉·克莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you do have any information as to the whereabouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.41,0:15:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你后裔的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Kelly Kline and the spawn of your loins…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.84,0:15:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好是告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you may want to give that information to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.28,0:15:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要做那样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why, oh, why would I do a thing like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.95,0:15:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 原来凯莉一直跟你的一个老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because turns out that Kelly's been chumming it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.63,0:15:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,混在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}with an old friend of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.22,0:15:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大衮 - 怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dagon. - So?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.39,0:15:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,大衮死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…Dagon dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.55,0:15:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉现在落入了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly's now in the clutches.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.66,0:15:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,温家兄弟的爱奴 卡西迪奥手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the Winchesters' love slave, Castiel,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.39,0:15:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他毫无疑问想让她死得很惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}who's no doubt dragging her to a gruesome death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.18,0:15:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你计划的有趣的死亡不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}As opposed to the fun-packed death you have planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.79,0:15:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的计划或许是救你儿子一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}My plan may just be to save your son's life,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.00,0:15:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他当自己的养大\N{\fnArial\fs30}raise him as my own,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.48,0:15:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他个机会用自己的力量为我效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}give him the chance to use his power in my service.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.00,0:15:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我或许是你们父子活着相见的唯一希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may be the only hope you have of seeing him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.74,0:15:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.96,0:16:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.63,0:16:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想吧 时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it. Tick-tock.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.94,0:16:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得马上出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to get out of here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.98,0:16:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚又完成了一个疗程\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just completed another session.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.08,0:16:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她进展很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's coming along nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.57,0:16:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想让我加快她的进展 海斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you wanted me to accelerate her progress, Dr. Hess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.36,0:17:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为我做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe I've achieved that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.76,0:17:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你叫我来的原因吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is why you brought me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.86,0:17:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 你是指望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, were you expecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.30,0:17:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人摸摸你的头吗 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}a pat on the head, Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.00,0:17:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我才不指望你会那么斯文呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. I would never expect civility from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.73,0:17:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,神经病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psychopath.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.83,0:17:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩凑到一起真有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two are such fun together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.18,0:17:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 她或许要做你的手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, she may be reporting to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.00,0:17:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是个行政派\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not really an administrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.77,0:17:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀人不眨眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kill without mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.37,0:17:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有问题的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.67,0:17:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, here you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.16,0:17:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着这女人受苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}watching this woman suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.41,0:17:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,几天前 你还跟她上了床\N{\fnArial\fs30}And only days ago, you were sleeping with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.55,0:17:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.69,0:17:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,等美国猎人都被消灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once the U.S. hunters are gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.86,0:18:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在认真考虑让你当家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm seriously considering putting you in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.06,0:18:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,太感谢您了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.64,0:18:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.01,0:18:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝维尔夫人也很想得到这份工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Bevell is also desperate for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.13,0:18:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.24,0:18:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也跟她睡过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You slept with her as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.31,0:18:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, no, I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.10,0:18:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.68,0:18:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在到处打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I've been calling around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.52,0:18:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,询问那些死去猎人的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}about all of the Hunters that died.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.42,0:18:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都经验丰富\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, every one of them had years of experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.41,0:18:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有封艾琳的来信\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a letter from Eileen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.75,0:18:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eileen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.13,0:18:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她四天前寄来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She sent it four days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.79,0:18:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她寄信是因为她觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}It went snail mail 'cause she thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.62,0:18:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她手机和电脑都被黑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that her phone and her computer were both hacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.26,0:18:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她离开爱尔兰是出于恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}She left Ireland because she was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.94,0:18:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 恐惧什么 - 她不小心杀了那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Scared of what? - Well, after she accidentally killed that …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.88,0:18:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国哥们兰尼后\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Brit douche Renny,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.13,0:18:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她觉得英国记录者在追杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}she thought that the British Men of Letters were on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.26,0:18:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我知道他们在跟踪我 监视我\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I know they're following me, watching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.10,0:18:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们窃听了我的手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}"They tapped my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.18,0:19:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在房间里发现了一个麦克风\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found a microphone in my room."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.35,0:19:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想这么撒娇 但我能跟你们住几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I hate to be all girly, but I could bunk with you guys for a days.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.46,0:19:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到事情解决吗「\N{\fnArial\fs30}until I sort this out""
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.98,0:19:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得英国人真在监视她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think the Brits were watching her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.66,0:19:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果艾琳说是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Eileen says they were …
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.73,0:19:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那或许就是他们杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then maybe they're the ones that killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.06,0:20:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你联络过的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Those Hueners you were talking to,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.30,0:20:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括泰瑞·马什吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is one of them Terry Marsh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.26,0:20:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 密苏里州的泰瑞·马什 我找过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Terry Marsh in Missouri. I talked to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.08,0:20:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}He, uh, he's also thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.21,0:20:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人的不是怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not monsters doing the real killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.97,0:20:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我收到了他的短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, I got a text from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.08,0:20:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直在到处打探\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been nosing around,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.40,0:20:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,说是已经知道是怎么回事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}says he's got a fair idea of what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.28,0:20:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么 - 他不敢在电话上说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And? - ‭He doesn't feel safe talking about it on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.88,0:20:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,想跟我们见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.74,0:20:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,州际公路旁的老钢铁厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old iron works off the interstate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.56,0:20:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,明晚9点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow night at 9:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.85,0:20:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让我们停在路边的仓库旁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says park off the road by the warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.60,0:20:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.25,0:21:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,您逃跑的时机至关重要 吾王\N{\fnArial\fs30}The timing of your escape is crucial, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.98,0:21:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果装置损坏得不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the device isn't sufficiently impaired,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.60,0:21:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王对您的控制只会加剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}the King's hold on you will only increase.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.03,0:21:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 我也…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, of course, I'll be …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.48,0:21:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你讲清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me perfectly clear, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.44,0:21:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唯一的儿子有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}My only son is in jeopardy,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.34,0:21:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我要没耐心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm running out of patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.18,0:21:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,再看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Check it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.96,0:21:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}This…this can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.64,0:21:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我它法力增强了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not tell me it's powering up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.55,0:21:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是增强了 - 我叫你别那么说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's powering up - I asked you not to tell me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.11,0:21:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是反方向增强的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in the opposite direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.93,0:21:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,太不可思议了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.26,0:21:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 那装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - ‭The device,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.58,0:21:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是直接与你的DNA\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's cemented directly into your DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.87,0:21:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,和国王的DNA融合的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that of the King's.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.06,0:21:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在你体内消减的同时\N{\fnArial\fs30}As it's powering down in you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.21,0:21:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,极性不知怎么逆转了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the polarity is somehow reversing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.42,0:22:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,说人话 德雷克索\N{\fnArial\fs30}English, Drexel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.29,0:22:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制权\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ability to control.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.08,0:22:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在转移\N{\fnArial\fs30}is transferring.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.06,0:22:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,从克劳力到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}from Crowley to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.73,0:22:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.13,0:22:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力要变成我的小走狗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Crowley's gonna be my puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.35,0:22:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖狗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.22,0:22:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为贝维尔夫人坐下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sat for Lady Bevell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.14,0:22:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么看得出\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you even tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.37,0:22:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我要说「坏狗狗」吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I gonna say "bad dog"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.42,0:22:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他脾气可挺爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭He can be unpleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.09,0:22:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,海斯博士说你想谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Hess says that you have designs on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.84,0:22:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,米克·戴维斯的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mick Davies' job.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.29,0:22:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.03,0:22:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她向我保证 会优先考虑我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She assured me it was mine to turn down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.36,0:22:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.18,0:22:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对我也是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She told me the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.68,0:22:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.50,0:23:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们彼此对立 就像在肯德里克斯时那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pitted against each other, like our days at Kendricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.81,0:23:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在那些情况下表现优异\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always did rather well in those situations.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.11,0:23:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你铲除对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You slaughtered the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.35,0:23:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候是真下杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.25,0:23:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我可没那么对过你 凯奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, I never slaughtered you, Ketch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.83,0:23:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我们做爱很频繁嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we were having a lot of sex at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.91,0:23:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我研究美国的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been studying the American Situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.85,0:23:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及如何治理好多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and how to fix it for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.40,0:23:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这份工作 是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this? Is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.08,0:23:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.14,0:23:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,精英总能登顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cream always rises to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.70,0:23:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.25,0:23:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯奇先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Ketch?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.40,0:23:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,犯人要见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prisoner is asking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.59,0:23:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,自大的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrogant bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.22,0:23:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝维尔夫人 我有新消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Bevell, I have news.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.33,0:24:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你不会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think you'd come.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.21,0:24:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快要疯了 凯奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm losing my mind, Ketch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.61,0:24:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道这是不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I actually don't know if this…is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.43,0:24:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想要我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.91,0:24:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经在做的事 玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly what you're doing, Mary,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.82,0:24:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你做得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're doing it splendidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.01,0:25:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.63,0:25:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a-a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.00,0:25:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经常那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.68,0:25:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来相信你们做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believed in what you people were doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.64,0:25:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你们一起作战 是希望我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fought with you so that my boys could maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.25,0:25:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许能生活在没有怪物的世界里\N{\fnArial\fs30}live in a world without monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.94,0:25:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you just …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.56,0:25:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你指望什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure what you're expecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.18,0:25:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我插手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I'll intervene?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.36,0:25:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说清楚了 我们又不是在恋爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made it clear to each other, we don't have a relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.53,0:25:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}We worked together.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.37,0:25:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.49,0:25:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们了解彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.99,0:25:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不了解你 玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know you, Mary. Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.62,0:25:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你更不了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You certainly don't know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.23,0:26:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会想了解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…wouldn't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.51,0:26:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.64,0:26:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.84,0:26:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Mary…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.35,0:26:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.91,0:26:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.95,0:26:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.12,0:26:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这辈子 我所拥有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All my life, all I ever had,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.85,0:26:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}other than my family,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.85,0:26:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我的意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}was my will.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.69,0:26:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我要失去它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's going away.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.56,0:26:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在伤害别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm … I'm putting people in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.69,0:26:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能会伤害我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm putting my sons in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.68,0:26:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…have to…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.17,0:26:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…please.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.52,0:26:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,看在老天的分上\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.32,0:27:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.34,0:27:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玛丽 - 动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mary. - ‭Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.43,0:27:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.20,0:27:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't be long now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.62,0:27:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都会结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will all be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.74,0:27:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.48,0:27:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - ‭I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.04,0:27:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.09,0:29:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再这样下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep that up,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.96,0:29:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就得开始约会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna have to start dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.33,0:29:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过不久 我当然要除掉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before long, of course, I will get rid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.28,0:29:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我会怀念我们的闲聊的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I will miss our little chats.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.82,0:29:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你就你想象的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, you mean the ones where you prattle on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.09,0:29:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,侃侃而谈 而我假装在听吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}about your imagined power, and I pretend to care?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.31,0:29:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样的闲聊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those chats?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.92,0:29:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,小路西法怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is Lucifer Jr.?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.35,0:29:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.40,0:29:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm…no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.08,0:29:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还活着呢 健壮得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still alive and kickin'. Strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.84,0:29:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子挺彪悍 我挺自豪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid's a bruiser. Sort of proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.69,0:30:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,别急着订亲子课\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, before you book a Daddy and Me class,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.93,0:30:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要向你保证 你的王位不会有继承人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must assure you there is no heir to your throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.60,0:30:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,温家兄弟不会再搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Winchesters wouldn't mess up a second time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.55,0:30:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好说 他们好像总是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know about that. Seems to be sort of their thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.44,0:30:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以为又把我关回了笼子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, they thought they would stuff me back in the Cage again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.13,0:30:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 由于我机智 你坐在了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, due to my cunning, here you sit,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.19,0:30:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全受我意志的奴役\N{\fnArial\fs30}a virtual slave to my will.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.24,0:30:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此自大 你和你的假儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the hubris … you and your pseudo son?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.32,0:30:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直痴心妄想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's delusional.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.40,0:30:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Despite your…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.68,0:30:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,败得很惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}epic collapse,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.47,0:30:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,却还是一直坚持幻想你能打败我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you persist in the fantasy that you will best me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.25,0:30:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的狂妄根本不能与我的妙计相比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your bluster is no match for my masterful strategies.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.51,0:30:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到底\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.12,0:30:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得承认 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have to concede that I have…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.40,0:30:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.94,0:31:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,「妙计」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Master strategist""
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.67,0:31:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,青蛙卡米特差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like Kermit the Frog.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.01,0:31:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的小木偶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my little Muppet!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.64,0:31:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力 没有你我可如何是好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley, what will I do without you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.12,0:31:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么监视我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you spying on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.35,0:31:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对艾琳·莱希知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and what do you know about Eileen Leahy?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.54,0:31:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.60,0:31:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you … did …did your people,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.71,0:31:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}did they kill her?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.62,0:31:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.14,0:31:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,经验法则 如果你觉得我们杀了谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rule of thumb … if you think we killed someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.08,0:31:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那八成是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we probably did.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.13,0:31:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,说起来 你们知道袭击我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of, you do realize that by attacking me,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.43,0:31:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是招来了整个英国记录者的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you invite the retribution of the entire.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.80,0:31:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,报复吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}British Men of Letters?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.98,0:31:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必调查 不用审判\N{\fnArial\fs30}No investigation, no trial. Just.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.60,0:31:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接惩罚毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}punishment and ruin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.44,0:31:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是由玛丽·温彻斯特执行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly at the hands of Mary Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.74,0:31:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.26,0:31:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈 成为我们的永久客人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother … she's our permanent guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.59,0:32:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被你们囚禁了 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's your prisoner? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.93,0:32:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,囚禁 谁说我们囚禁她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prisoner? Who said anything about prisoner?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.50,0:32:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 玛丽加入我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Mary's joined the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.62,0:32:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有她自己的绝密解码戒指了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even has her own super secret decoder ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.56,0:32:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.63,0:32:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 没有戒指的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. There is no ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.90,0:32:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,男孩和妈妈啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boys and their mums.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.77,0:32:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 你们视她为妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, you see her as Mummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.59,0:32:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们视她为我们最好的杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We see her as one of our best killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.90,0:32:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为她跟凯奇合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, just 'cause she works with Ketch.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.95,0:32:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不代表她喜欢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't mean she likes him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.74,0:32:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.84,0:32:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,又被恋母情结蒙蔽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that Oedipal myopia again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.50,0:32:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真觉得她跟凯奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}And did you really think she was just.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.52,0:32:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是「合作」关系吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}"working" with Ketch?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.70,0:32:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么多日日夜夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of those days and nights?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.34,0:32:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.93,0:32:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说有几次是他最棒的性经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said it was some of the best sex he'd ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.25,0:32:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要不要换个说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna rethink that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.20,0:32:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.85,0:32:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说那一次是他最棒的性经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said it was the best sex he'd ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.17,0:32:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.65,0:32:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 继续说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - Keep it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.91,0:32:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那米克呢 他扮演了什么角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Mick? Where is he in all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.68,0:32:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 米克 - 对 米克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mick? - ‭Yes, Mick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.04,0:32:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,米克死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Mick's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.63,0:33:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.14,0:33:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.66,0:33:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被认为太重情义 不适合这份工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was determined he was too sentimental for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.70,0:33:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来 他太像你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out, he was too much like you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.00,0:33:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,和其他美国猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all the other U.S. hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.67,0:33:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此 这国家的每个猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ergo, soon each and every Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.60,0:33:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,也很快将跟他团聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}in this country will join him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.73,0:33:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪·米尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody Mills,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.10,0:33:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔·诺瓦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire Novak,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.69,0:33:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所有其他穿法兰绒\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of your other flannel-wearing,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.80,0:33:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝威士忌的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}whiskey-swilling friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.16,0:33:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.90,0:33:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 感觉太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Yeah, that feels awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.31,0:33:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,肌肉抽筋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Muscle cramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.62,0:33:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道好普拉提课程吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know a good Pilates class?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.21,0:33:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,说清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}So to be clear,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.85,0:33:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接受你现在是老大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I accept that you are now in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.20,0:33:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更喜欢这新的秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I like this new arrangement better.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.13,0:33:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你更多是个看大局的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're more the big picture guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.69,0:34:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我则是管理日常杂物的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the day-to-day minutiae…guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.47,0:34:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,8号球 底袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}8 ball, corner pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.08,0:34:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以这么玩一整天 但既然我是国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I could do this all day, but since I'm King,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.17,0:34:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}et cetera, et cetera.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.17,0:34:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来收个尾吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll wrap it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.76,0:35:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定知道这是迟早的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you had to know this was inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.66,0:35:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这要疼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.44,0:36:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,清理干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clean up on aisle 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.17,0:36:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,听明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.76,0:36:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打给凯奇 告诉他 如果不想你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call Ketch, tell him if he wants to see you alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.61,0:36:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就给我们过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}he gets his prissy ass over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.42,0:36:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有趣的是 他已经来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interestingly, his prissy ass is already here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.53,0:36:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝维尔夫人 你能不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Bevell, would you mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.70,0:36:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,解除他们的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}disarming them?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.88,0:37:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 起来 - 好了 凯奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get up. - ‭All right, Ketch,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.70,0:37:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里还有多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}how many more guys are in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.75,0:37:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们妈妈 她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our mom … Where is she?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.86,0:37:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.33,0:37:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, speak of the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.70,0:37:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,来得正好 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect timing, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.98,0:37:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.78,0:37:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.53,0:37:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was talkin' to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.14,0:37:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.39,0:37:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯奇 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ketch, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.99,0:37:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好别动 她会开枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really wouldn't move. She will shoot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.54,0:38:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈一直是个厉害的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Mummy always was a talented Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.13,0:38:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是 对服从命令有点糊涂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just somewhat…confused about obeying orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.32,0:38:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把她怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.06,0:38:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝维尔夫人 让她不糊涂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Bevell cleared up that…confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.64,0:38:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想她已经告诉你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I suspect she told you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.62,0:38:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国猎人都要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the American Hunters are a dying breed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.21,0:38:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天啊 你是想去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}For heaven's sake, where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.17,0:38:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯奇 - 记得在肯德里克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ketch. - ‭Remember at Kendricks,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.19,0:38:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们教我们 我们都是可以牺牲的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}how they taught us that we were all expendable?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.81,0:38:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是闲谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't idle chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.95,0:38:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.05,0:38:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.15,0:38:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们啊 求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's us. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.11,0:38:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么了 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with you? Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.62,0:39:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的地堡真是绝佳的堡垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your bunker is an excellent fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.52,0:39:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是更好的坟墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}An even better tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.83,0:39:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对锁做了改造\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we've rejiggered the locks,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.23,0:39:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,切断了水\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've shut off the water, and.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.08,0:39:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们走后 抽入空气的泵\N{\fnArial\fs30}once we leave, the pumps that bring in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.08,0:39:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,会逆转\N{\fnArial\fs30}shall reverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.67,0:39:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的氧气会在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your oxygen should be gone in…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.11,0:39:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,两到三天内耗尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}two days, maybe three.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.65,0:39:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们死在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You dying in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.13,0:39:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's almost…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.63,0:39:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些诗意\N{\fnArial\fs30}poetic, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.75,0:39:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come along, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.15,0:39:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ketch! ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.33,0:39:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.25,0:40:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要求在他回来前收拾好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants this done before he returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.87,0:40:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个我们怎么处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we supposed to do with…that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.96,0:40:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.71,0:40:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝维尔夫人真是厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do have to hand it to Lady Bevell.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.97,0:40:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your treatment's been.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.60,0:40:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,到目前为止非常成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}most successful so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.74,0:40:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道 这\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so you know, this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.83,0:40:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,会\N{\fnArial\fs30}will become…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.13,0:40:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,越来越轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.72,0:40:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easier…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.52,0:40:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤害我爱的人会越来越轻松吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to hurt people I love?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.57,0:40:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤害你不记得你爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easier to hurt people you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.41,0:41:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,会越来越轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}remember loving.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.73,0:41:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.13,0:41:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.35,0:41:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.73,0:41:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son.
